<html xmlns:o='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office' xmlns:w='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40'><head><meta charset='utf-8'><title>Export HTML To Doc</title></head><body><div><br><br><br><br><span>To the PRS Manager,</span><br><br><span>January 14, 2025</span><br> <h3><u>RE: SENDER ID WHITELISTING REQUEST</u></h3><br><p>With Respect, <br><br> In order to improve service that will bring added value to our customers, we appoint <b>Infinity Tech</b> to provide the  needed support and carry on the activities that are necessary for sustainable SMS service and registration of sender id below: </p><br><table width='100%'><thead style='border:1px solid #3c4043;'><tr><th width='50%' style='padding:10px;border-right:1px solid #3c4043;text-align:center;'>SENDER ID</th><th width='50%' style='padding:10px;text-align:center;'>PURPOSE</th></tr></thead><tbody style='border:1px solid #3c4043;'><tr><td style='padding:20px;border-right:1px solid #3c4043;text-align:center;'>teeflex</td><td style='padding:20px;text-align:center;'>This will be used for Sending Transactional SMS to our customers and partners.</td></tr></tbody></table><br><br><span>Yours Sincerely,</span><br><br><span><b>Name</b></span><br><br><span><i>(Sign and Stamp)</i></span><br><br><span><b>CEO/General Manager</b></span></div></body></html>